{"dur": 27.1, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "On m'a dit que c'était impossible.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 3.103, "words": [{"w": "On", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "m'a", "t": 1.368}, {"w": "dit", "t": 1.592}, {"w": "que", "t": 1.816}, {"w": "c'était", "t": 2.04}, {"w": "impossible.", "t": 2.487}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Un outil de ferraillage… fait ici, par nous.", "t0": 3.903, "t1": 6.469, "words": [{"w": "Un", "t": 3.903}, {"w": "outil", "t": 4.064}, {"w": "de", "t": 4.384}, {"w": "ferraillage…", "t": 4.545}, {"w": "fait", "t": 5.507}, {"w": "ici,", "t": 5.774}, {"w": "par", "t": 5.988}, {"w": "nous.", "t": 6.201}]}, {"id": "histoire", "text": "Pas acheté. Pas copié. Écrit ligne par ligne, pour nos poutres, nos normes, nos chantiers.", "t0": 7.169, "t1": 12.373, "words": [{"w": "Pas", "t": 7.169}, {"w": "acheté.", "t": 7.414}, {"w": "Pas", "t": 7.842}, {"w": "copié.", "t": 8.087}, {"w": "Écrit", "t": 8.454}, {"w": "ligne", "t": 8.822}, {"w": "par", "t": 9.189}, {"w": "ligne,", "t": 9.434}, {"w": "pour", "t": 9.801}, {"w": "nos", "t": 10.108}, {"w": "poutres,", "t": 10.352}, {"w": "nos", "t": 10.842}, {"w": "normes,", "t": 11.087}, {"w": "nos", "t": 11.516}, {"w": "chantiers.", "t": 11.761}]}, {"id": "etat", "text": "Aujourd'hui, la poutre fonctionne. Les poteaux, les dalles et les semelles arrivent.", "t0": 12.753, "t1": 17.457, "words": [{"w": "Aujourd'hui,", "t": 12.753}, {"w": "la", "t": 13.45}, {"w": "poutre", "t": 13.624}, {"w": "fonctionne.", "t": 14.03}, {"w": "Les", "t": 14.669}, {"w": "poteaux,", "t": 14.902}, {"w": "les", "t": 15.366}, {"w": "dalles", "t": 15.598}, {"w": "et", "t": 16.005}, {"w": "les", "t": 16.179}, {"w": "semelles", "t": 16.411}, {"w": "arrivent.", "t": 16.934}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI : l'intelligence de l'armature.", "t0": 17.837, "t1": 21.5, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 17.837}, {"w": "AI", "t": 18.622}, {"w": ":", "t": 18.883}, {"w": "l'intelligence", "t": 18.97}, {"w": "de", "t": 20.279}, {"w": "l'armat